:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="FigureCaption"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Original screenshot: complaint submission – documents stage and error message</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:spacing w:after="40"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:drawing><wp:inline xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:pic="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><wp:extent cx="6080760" cy="3943118"/><wp:docPr id="13" name="Picture 13"/><wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphicFrameLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphic><a:graphicData uri="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><pic:pic><pic:nvPicPr><pic:cNvPr id="0" name="p7_2.png"/><pic:cNvPicPr/></pic:nvPicPr><pic:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId21"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></pic:blipFill><pic:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="6080760" cy="3943118"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"/></pic:spPr></pic:pic></a:graphicData></a:graphic></wp:inline></w:drawing></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="FigureCaption"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Original screenshot: complaint submission – additional user example</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:spacing w:after="40"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:drawing><wp:inline xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:pic="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><wp:extent cx="6080760" cy="4527086"/><wp:docPr id="14" name="Picture 14"/><wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphicFrameLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphic><a:graphicData uri="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><pic:pic><pic:nvPicPr><pic:cNvPr id="0" name="p8_1.png"/><pic:cNvPicPr/></pic:nvPicPr><pic:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId22"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></pic:blipFill><pic:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="6080760" cy="4527086"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"/></pic:spPr></pic:pic></a:graphicData></a:graphic></wp:inline></w:drawing></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="FigureCaption"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Original screenshot: complaint submission error following attempted submission</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>6. Institutional Model and Governance</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>An institution is an administrative or official organisation to which an NTB case may be assigned for processing, monitoring or supervision.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>The following distinctions should be made:</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="ListBullet"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Institution: the body responsible for processing a case;</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="ListBullet"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>User: a person who has an account;</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="ListBullet"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Role: the user’s permission level.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:spacing w:after="40"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:drawing><wp:inline xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:pic="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><wp:extent cx="6080760" cy="1603607"/><wp:docPr id="15" name="Picture 15"/><wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphicFrameLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphic><a:graphicData uri="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><pic:pic><pic:nvPicPr><pic:cNvPr id="0" name="p8_2.png"/><pic:cNvPicPr/></pic:nvPicPr><pic:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId23"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></pic:blipFill><pic:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="6080760" cy="1603607"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"/></pic:spPr></pic:pic></a:graphicData></a:graphic></wp:inline></w:drawing></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="FigureCaption"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Original screenshot: case assignments by institution</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading2"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>6.1. Important Missing Institutions</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Analysis of the platform shows that certain institutions identified in the SDS are not yet represented, or are not clearly represented, in the system.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>National Monitoring Committee (CNS)</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>The SDS assigns it a central role: “Coordination, arbitration and supervision”.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>The CNS should therefore be represented within the platform’s institutional/governance model and have access rights corresponding to its responsibilities.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Ministry of Transport</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>The SDS assigns it, in particular, responsibility for: “Coordination of corridor-related issues”.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>It should therefore be included among the institutions that can participate in processing NTB cases relating to transport and corridors.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:spacing w:after="40"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:drawing><wp:inline xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:pic="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><wp:extent cx="6080760" cy="3146049"/><wp:docPr id="16" name="Picture 16"/><wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphicFrameLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphic><a:graphicData uri="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><pic:pic><pic:nvPicPr><pic:cNvPr id="0" name="p9_1.png"/><pic:cNvPicPr/></pic:nvPicPr><pic:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId24"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></pic:blipFill><pic:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="6080760" cy="3146049"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"/></pic:spPr></pic:pic></a:graphicData></a:graphic></wp:inline></w:drawing></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="FigureCaption"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Original screenshot: role catalogue</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="Heading1"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>6. Roles and Permissions</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>The section on roles is broadly consistent with the SDS. A technical error occurs when using the role-assignment function:</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:spacing w:after="40"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:drawing><wp:inline xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:pic="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><wp:extent cx="6080760" cy="2282294"/><wp:docPr id="17" name="Picture 17"/><wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphicFrameLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphic><a:graphicData uri="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><pic:pic><pic:nvPicPr><pic:cNvPr id="0" name="p10_1.png"/><pic:cNvPicPr/></pic:nvPicPr><pic:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId25"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></pic:blipFill><pic:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="6080760" cy="2282294"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"/></pic:spPr></pic:pic></a:graphicData></a:graphic></wp:inline></w:drawing></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="FigureCaption"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Original screenshot: error displayed when applying role assignment</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Call to undefined relationship [role] on model [App\Models\UserRoleAssignment].</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:r><w:t>Impact: This error probably indicates a problem with the relationship between the UserRoleAssignment model and the corresponding role model.</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:spacing w:after="40"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:drawing><wp:inline xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:pic="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><wp:extent cx="6080760" cy="3017028"/><wp:docPr id="18" name="Picture 18"/><wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphicFrameLocks noChangeAspect="1"/></wp:cNvGraphicFramePr><a:graphic><a:graphicData uri="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/picture"><pic:pic><pic:nvPicPr><pic:cNvPr id="0" name="p10_2.png"/><pic:cNvPicPr/></pic:nvPicPr><pic:blipFill><a:blip r:embed="rId26"/><a:stretch><a:fillRect/></a:stretch></pic:blipFill><pic:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="6080760" cy="3017028"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"/></pic:spPr></pic:pic></a:graphicData></a:graphic></wp:inline></w:drawing></w:r></w:p><w:p><w:pPr><w:pStyle w:val="FigureCaption"/><w:jc w:val="center"/></w:pPr><w:r><w:t>Original screenshot: user list, assigned institutions, roles and status</w:t></w:r></w:p><w:sectPr w:rsidR="00FC693F" w:rsidRPr="0006063C" w:rsidSect="00034616"><w:footerReference w:type="default" r:id="rId27"/><w:pgSz w:w="12240" w:h="15840"/><w:pgMar w:top="1008" w:right="1152" w:bottom="936" w:left="1152" w:header="720" w:footer="720" w:gutter="0"/><w:cols w:space="720"/><w:docGrid w:linePitch="360"/></w:sectPr></w:body></w:document>